      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "MarkdownNote"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Auto-Size Retouch (2BZ · toobusy 0.5.6 + VOSR 2.0 + SeedVR2)\n\n**Put an image in ① and just run.** No prompt.\n\n### The idea — size is the answer\nRetouching works dramatically when **the face is about 200px during processing**. That's why character sheets worked so well: their faces are already that size.\nSo SAM3 measures the face → **VOSR 2.0 enlarges to that size** (faithful to structure) → **SeedVR2 adds texture** → saved **at the enlarged size**.\n- 1MP full-body shot (face ~100px) → about 2x (4MP) · sheets / group shots → based on the largest face\n- Close-ups / large sheets (face already 200px+) → **skips VOSR2** and retouches at original size (close-ups rarely need retouching anyway)\n- No face found → around 4MP\nThe Plan node shows face size, scale and output size.\n\n### Knobs\n- **③ `target_face_px`** default 200 — higher is crisper, too high (~400) looks unnatural. Measured sweet spot: 200.\n- `pick` largest = use the largest face (recommended) · `max_scale` 4 = up to 4x per side (16x area)\n- **VRAM**: ⑤ `tile_megapixels` (8GB 1 / 12GB 1.5–2 / 24GB 3–4); VOSR2 `vae_tile_size` 512 default (~5.3GB)\n- Two outputs: **High** (rest 1.25 / skin 1.0) · **Low** (1.0 / 0.9 — use if High looks too sharp)\n\n### Models (click to download)\n- [seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/diffusion_models/seedvr2_3b_int8_convrot.safetensors) → `models/diffusion_models/`\n- [seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/SeedVR2/resolve/main/vae/seedvr2_ema_vae_fp16.safetensors) → `models/vae/`\n- [sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/sam3.1/resolve/main/checkpoints/sam3.1_multiplex_fp16.safetensors) → `models/checkpoints/`\n- VOSR 2.0 — auto-downloads on first run (~7GB) → `models/vosr2/VOSR2/`\n\n### Required nodes (search in ComfyUI Manager)\n- **toobusy 0.5.6+** (`toobusy`) · **VOSR 2.0** (`VOSR` → comfyui-vosr2) · SAM3 and SeedVR2 are ComfyUI core\n\n### Measured (RTX 3090 · 2026-10-15)\n| Input | Plan | Output | Time |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1MP full-body (face 98px) | ×2.04 | 1696×2512 | 55s |\n| 1.6MP storyboard (6 faces, largest 113px) | ×1.78 | 2576×1936 | 43s |\n| 1MP close-up (face 728px) | VOSR2 skipped | original size | 15s |\n| 18.7MP character sheet | VOSR2 skipped | original size | 65s |\n| 0.6MP small face (54px) | ×3.73 | 2864×2864 | 59s |\n\nPeak VRAM about 12GB (incl. 2GB idle · VOSR2 + SeedVR2 + SAM3). Untested on 8GB cards — keep ⑤ `tile_megapixels` 1 and VOSR2 `vae_tile_size` 512.\n"
      ],
      "title": "⓪ Read me first"
    }
